Z||000000||Greg Piet||05-30-2001||07:53 PM||||Has anyone installed one of these babies yet or am I gonna have to be the first PFF member doing it? <A HREF="http://webhome.idirect.com/~rsm1/" TARGET=_blank>http://webhome.idirect.com/~rsm1/</A> <P>How about with a 3.1 stroker?<BR>I am guessing a larger ThrottleBody, FuelPressReg, FuelInj's, and FuelPump are needed as well.<P><P>------------------<BR>SCCA Region 72 Race Director<BR>#47 SM<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.physics.unlv.edu/~gregpiet/Jan1617s.jpg">    <BR>Our lady of blessed acceleration dont fail me now!||||reg||1
